   "en": "The mishna continues: «And» the defining characteristics of «this» category of Ox «and that» category of Maveh, «in which there is a living spirit,» are not similar to the defining characteristic of the category of Fire, in which there is no living spirit. The Gemara asks: «What is» the tanna «saying? Rav Mesharshiyya said in the name of Rava» that «this is» what the tanna «is saying:»"
